{"server":"cn","storyId":"act35side_level_act35side_st01","groupId":"act35side","stageId":"act35side_st01","title":"辉煌之城","storyCode":"AS-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"5b42c14224f4fa447c94f08061d26607f0725ba3f9d6c4b510c3daff67238957","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"米纳特哈玛仪的博物馆内，代理馆长阿娜特与副馆长梅捷缇克缇正等待一位尊贵客人——帕夏之女佩佩。佩佩此次前来正是想要借用博物馆的镇馆之宝——无名将领。但她不知道，沙盗娜仁图亚也跟随着她来到城中。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g5_museum"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的女孩","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那盏灯再吊高一些，我需要打在展品上的灯光完美地照出每一处细节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博物馆员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，馆长女士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的女孩","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁把这尊歌女胸像放在古历纪暗阑时代的雕像群中的？它们根本不在一个时代，快取出来，送到第二展厅去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博物馆员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去送！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的女孩","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那件按古历纪咏叹时代制作技艺复原的乐器呢？为什么我没在展台上看到？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的女孩","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在这里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的女孩","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不在这里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉悦的歌声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪远方的客人啊，莲花池中潋滟的水波泛过你来时的足迹♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉悦的歌声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪树荫下，我备好了清甜的椰枣与醇香的啤酒♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉悦的歌声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪何不一同举杯，共庆盛夏♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，梅捷缇克缇女士，您的歌声就像天籁，萦绕不停！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奉承的员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，梅捷缇克缇女士，您的琴音正如流水，缓缓流淌！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然，为了完美演绎这首古老的歌谣，我可是苦练了一个多月。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的女孩","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的女孩","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，你们一个个说起话来像嘴上抹了蜜，干起活来就像脚底抹了油，根本找不到影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的女孩","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缇缇，你应该知道，明天这件复原乐器就要展出了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天先借迎宾部一用嘛，阿娜特。有贵宾莅临，本馆总是要好好招待一番的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是为漫灌节准备的特别展会，缇缇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当前我们首要的任务是确保展会的每个环节都不出错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的人眼光有多挑剔，你作为老员工应该比我更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别抓狂嘛，馆长大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你刚上任就要策划如此重要的展会，难免会有点小焦虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但相信我，阿娜特，放平心态就好。无论我们展出什么，都会有人挑刺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟米纳特哈玛仪城中，家家户户都有些珍贵的小私藏，看不上我们的展品很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我要去查看明天亮相的新展品了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我不会去打扰你和那位男士约会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它是我的研究对象，不是约会对象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你看它的目光实在太深情了嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说这都几点了，那些家伙还没接到人吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无所事事的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜，那个女孩是在观察水利设施的运作，好写一篇城市水利发展史的论文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百无聊赖的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许她是个铭文学家，只是在清理河中石碑上的污泥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无所事事的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，有什么区别呢？不都是些搞历史的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无所事事的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能怪我们的城市历史太悠久，全萨尔贡的史学家都喜欢往这里跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百无聊赖的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，看这四百年的古代河道，又宽又阔，看这两百年的建筑，又高又大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百无聊赖的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么叫厚重的历史传承？这就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无所事事的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那有什么能比得上漫灌节呢？那可是承自千年前的传统节日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百无聊赖的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，等到河水泛滥，我将为河中的神明献上产自绿洲的洁白花朵，愿祂鼻息间皆为永恒的芬芳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百无聊赖的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又准备了什么，朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无所事事的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是按照家里的传统来，纯金打造的杯盏与碗碟，还有一罐葡萄酒......那是我祖父在我父亲出生时封入泥土的陈年佳酿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无所事事的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿祂尽享美味佳肴，与我们共享节日的热闹气氛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百无聊赖的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿你我能亲眼得见祂漫步人间的身影，获得祂的赐福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百无聊赖的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬不朽的米纳特哈玛仪，愿祂永远栖身在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岸边的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你找到了没有呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等，小朋友，我刚刚好像摸到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岸边的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你已经站在水里快一个半小时了，每次都说快要摸到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘......不要吵我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g1_menatmainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，那位大小姐又跑去哪里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明每个城门外都安排了专人等候，却没有一个人看到过她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了迎接你我可是费了不少心思，怎么可能就让你悄无声息地混进来呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢乐的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"午安，梅捷缇克缇女士，您这样匆匆忙忙是要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，贝克特夫人，是你啊，我是要去见一位老朋友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢乐的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我刚从院子里采摘的甜橙，漫灌节前结出的，味道一定能征服所有人的胃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢乐的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿一些给你的朋友吧，梅捷缇克缇女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我替那位不爱领人情的客人谢谢你。回见了，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢乐的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回见！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的人总是这么热情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......让我想想那家伙到底去哪里了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年一起在学校的时候，她最爱往哪里跑？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异乡的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，女士，真的抱歉，我没有看到你，害你的橙子撒了一地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没关系，你呢？没有事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异乡的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你的原谅，好心的女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异乡的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么突然皱紧了眉头？哪里受伤了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异乡的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚，在你的额头有一片阴影掠过，这不是什么好征兆，它预示着你会遭遇厄运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异乡的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你愿意花费五个第纳尔，我可以为你消除厄运的侵袭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......那个，女士，我着急赴约，先走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异乡的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！哎！等等，两个第纳尔也行啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异乡的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不骗你，你是真的会倒霉哇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岸边的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会骗我吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，姐姐我说过的话，从来没有不算数的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岸边的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗，呜......可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别哭，我就要......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不好，让它又跑掉了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别哭别哭，我刚刚是逗你的！我其实捉到了，你看，不就在我手心里面吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伤心的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐坏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗐......平时在家里作弄弟弟习惯了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伤心的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你弟弟真可怜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里可怜了，那家伙也没少作弄我好吧。好啦，罐子递给我吧，我帮你把鳞装进罐子里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"啜泣的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为这条金色的小鳞再也找不回来了......谢谢姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧啧，我费这么大力气帮你捉鳞，你就这么点音量，大声点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"啜泣的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢姐姐，你最厉害了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，赶紧回家去吧，千万可别再突发奇想，学别人在外面遛自己家的宠物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开心的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在河里遛宠物鳞？原来不止我小时候会做这种异想天开的事情啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，看来我在这水里摸了这么久的鳞，终于有人看不下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你也知道我是什么心情啊，佩佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我还不想那么早就跑去博物馆嘛，到时候阿娜特缠着我问东问西，肯定一点都闲不下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么只有你一个人来？阿娜特呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她啊，作为代理馆长本来事情就多，最近还碰上重量级的展会，更是忙得脚不沾地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，想不到阿娜特刚来就高升了。记得在学院的时候，很多人都不看好她温吞的性格，但我觉得她做事认真，肯定能成就一番事业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她骨子里一直是强硬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就不说说你自己？在这座城市待了这么久，你没什么变化吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我嘛，不忙也不闲，现在勉强拿到了副馆长的头衔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前在哥伦比亚的博物馆不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时负责那里的商业运营，来了这里环境不一样嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米纳特哈玛仪的博物馆又不用挣钱，光靠王酋和帕夏们每年的支持就能良好运转，我又派不上用场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挺好，我乐得清闲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你从前......一向是闲不下来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？此次旅途中，一定有很多收获吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多到难以想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......那你要做的报告也一定多到难以想象吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦，不行，好热，我感觉有点中暑，得在这里多吹吹风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少来，这个借口当年我在学院里帮你请假用过多少遍了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您在这里坐了很久，太阳这么晒，请问您需要来点饮料吗？本店招牌光果甘草汁，鲜榨的，只要五个第纳尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者苹果玫瑰茄茶？两个第纳尔一杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么来杯杏子汁吗？只要一个第纳尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，“不要”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，侍者，先别走，给我来一壶你们最好的咖啡，要加本地特产的豆蔻和丁香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再来一杯光果甘草汁给那位女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请稍等，二位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您来到米纳特哈玛仪享受漫灌节，怎能不准备好充足的预算呢？这样，您的旅行体验可是会大打折扣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无意冒犯，我始终觉得大家的消费应当符合自己的收入水平，如果资金不充足，还有很多别的好地方可以选来度假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说玻利瓦尔的多索雷斯就不错，物价低廉，风景又漂亮，适合......生活比较拮据的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......听起来很有道理，你真是见多识广。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过奖了。您呢？走在开拓自己眼界的路上吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路上？......算是吧，我在寻找我的路途。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您的咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放那里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您的光果甘草汁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一饮而尽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你的款待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）啧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侍者，能不能给我介绍一下，在你们的漫灌节上，都有些什么乐子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这是什么表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没......只是很惊讶，那位女士不肯花钱点饮料，却给了这么多小费......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，看来我是撞上了死要面子的穷鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我还是自己出去找乐子吧。侍者，麻烦结账。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一共十五第纳尔，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阔绰的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我的钱包怎么不见了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿河流带走这些镀金的废铁，但愿河水上涨时它们被需要的人捡到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......浪费时间，差点让我跟丢了目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说......辉煌之城遍地宝石，还有无数勇士寻求未果的宝藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果我走了那么远，来到这里，却不断遇到只为几枚金币计较的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"},{"type":"narration","text":"一片阴云飘来，遮住了烈日刺目的光芒，红发的女人从钱囊里倒出金币，一枚枚掷出，不偏不倚，打碎河中日影。\n随即，她便吹着口哨，消失在人群中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......大巴扎的杏子汁还是这么好喝，和在学院时味道一模一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本猜你会来这里，在人群中转了好久也没看到你，最后才想起，以前在学院的时候，都是我们三人一起来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当你独处时，总是会去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"河边......我一个人总爱去河边逛逛。不过，你居然为了找我跑了这么多地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可是贵客啊，佩佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是朋友，怎么讲究起这个来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会是搞了什么让人脚趾抠地的尴尬演出来迎接我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那都是该有的礼数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少来，我都听见你肚子里的坏水哐当作响了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这次带来了什么大发现？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一块宝石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝石？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石商贩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蓝宝石手串，蓝宝石项链，蓝宝石耳环，一整套随意搭配，只要两千第纳尔，看上就拿走，不还价不讲价，只要两千第纳尔就拿走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边喇叭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"顾客朋友你们好，本店精选祖母绿戒指，一整箱购买享受低价折扣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边喇叭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"保质保重，便宜实惠，个个都有十五克拉，买回去送亲戚送朋友，只要四千五百第纳尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视广告","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"红宝蓝宝金绿宝，紫晶粉晶橄榄晶，买宝石就来大巴扎，天天批发价，低价始终如一。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米纳特哈玛仪盛产各种宝石，如果仅是一块普通宝石，那可不够看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我发掘到的宝石还是有些不凡之处的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不凡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"品味不俗的妇人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我最近买到了一颗粉蓝晶石，号称曾被用来净化水源。上面刻的源石回路非常精细，就像艺术品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华美的男子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听起来很有价值，我上个月也收了一颗类似的碧玺，镶在了手杖上，能大幅增强施放的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气派不凡的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那都不重要，喏，看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"品味不俗的妇人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这不是去年的限量宝石腰带吗？卖家不是号称这条腰带可以改善皮肤代谢，减缓衰老的速度？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华美的男子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老人家您佩戴下来是什么感受？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气派不凡的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我确实感觉到自己神清气爽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......和他们这些大巴扎里尚在流通的宝石相比，我发掘的这颗可有一些罕见的功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罕见在哪里？即便是这些流通在大巴扎里的源石回路宝石，也是普通人难以见到的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先走吧，缇缇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是什么见不得人的秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不是，放心啦，肯定会和你讲的，不过——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在热辣的太阳升得更高前，我得去七芒星大道买一尊祈愿雕像，做研究也是需要神明赐福的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你可得快点走，一会儿那条路就要烫脚了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"目标正在向城中心的博物馆走去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能让本地博物馆的副馆长亲自来迎接，看来消息说的没错，她的身份确实不一般。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g1_menatmainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！你找到的那块宝石是沙阿遗物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......早知道就不穿露脚趾的凉鞋了，等会我脚上一定全是晒的凉鞋印。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然还在想凉鞋的事？那块宝石到底在哪里发现的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在一片曾被叫做舒巴特-阿尔萨兰的土地发现了线索，几经波折，最终在一个王酋的领地找到了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“群狮旧座”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还在一处晶洞中见到了一段沙阿本人留下的古代影像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这一路的发现，我都记在这份手札中，它会向世人揭晓那处丰盈满溢的宝库的真正位置，证明当年沙阿向梦魇许下的诺言并非传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想想，如果我们进入宝库，那里会有什么等待着我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"且不论那些稀世珍宝价值几何，重要的是它蕴含的信息将为我们还原出当年的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缇缇，沙阿所留下的那些不解之谜将一一得到回答！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他当年为何做出这看似疯癫的邀战之约？还有他和哈兰杜汗的惊世一战的真相！甚至是他最后的去向！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这将是震撼人心的发现！就连黄金之城都会向我投来目光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然知道位置，直接带人进行发掘就好，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，还差最后一条线索，我需要借用博物馆的一件文物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是帕夏的女儿，除了公开展出的文物，博物馆仓库的大门也随时向你敞开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢着，你难道是盯上......"},{"type":"narration","text":"佩佩看到博物馆的外墙上，幕布正缓缓展开。\n幕布上面绘着一具身披金甲的尸体，脸部被面具遮盖，身形修长。\n而在幕布的底端，有一行大字醒目无比："},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"法尔贾万达巴德博物馆周年纪念重磅展品——沙阿时代的无名将领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将领？不，他可是那间宝库的守卫者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论它到底是谁，它都是阿娜特最为看重的展品，恐怕没有那么容易借到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一颗附带着线索的宝石证明不了什么，我只有找到沙阿的宝库才能向父亲和陛下证明自己的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"证明我有能力进入黄金之城，成为陛下的史官，记述整个萨尔贡的历史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做帕夏的继承人不好吗，佩佩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些财富与权力，不过是繁荣的表象。真正贯穿我们家族每一代的荣耀，是世代相传的史官职位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可佩佩......伯父不是一直属意你的弟弟担任史官的职位吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他具备的品行素质我都有，论能力，我也绝不会输给他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩佩，再过两个月，就会有使者引领你弟弟去往黄金之城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来得及，缇缇！只要你愿意帮我！阿娜特要我等到夏天结束，才能将那具尸体借给我研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这个夏天是我最后的机会了，我等不了那么久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们姐弟两个也真是......小时候就总打架，长大了又要为同一个位置争个不可开交。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是我的通行证，拿去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以晚上进入展馆内偷偷研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你们争来夺去这些年，我也是腻味了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再帮你尝试一次，如果到最后，你还是一无所获，就不要再执拗下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会。不会一无所获的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_i01"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有理会佩佩的自言自语，梅捷缇克缇缓缓站起身，看向那座历经数百年岁月的宏伟建筑。\n太阳将花园与建筑照得明亮，无边的蓝色天空下，巨大的梯形建筑矗立。\n一旁高大的棕榈树，被风吹动，发出沙沙的树叶摩擦声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尽管每天都会看到，但我依然为它的气势所震撼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年，它静静守在这座城市中，默默与岁月相抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，在它面前，人的一生再漫长，也不过是一瞬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"眨眼间......就过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是时光能定格在某一刻就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那该有多好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明天展会见了。到时候被发现就说通行证是你偷的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g1_menatmainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天......博物馆展会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，来宾的行程已经确定，接下来就要好好招待一番了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辉煌的史官家族传人、王者与英雄的传颂者、足迹遍布萨尔贡的探险家、博闻之人、尊贵的帕夏之女——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珠娜佩卡佩-萨琪特-哈特谢普苏特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的女人","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换了别人，多半会为自己没法一下子记住这么多人而烦恼，但站在这里的是娜仁图亚，她只会为这些头衔其实是同一个人而遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算只绑架她一个，赎金应该也够我还债了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钱包里剩下的钱应该能买张明天的票......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队伍太长，太阳太晒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这座城市里金币太不值钱......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g1_menatmainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能向你们黄金的太阳、辉煌的宝石和你身后的大博物馆发誓吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能基于对历史与文明的尊重审慎回答吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叩问你自己的良心，告诉我，博物馆的门票价格是多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博物馆售票员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再说一遍，非萨尔贡历史文物的展馆是免票的，只有萨尔贡相关展馆需要买票进入，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博物馆售票员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您如果看不懂这里，您面前的这块售票窗口玻璃上有配套游览服务的价目表，您可以租借博物馆的翻译服务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米诺斯展厅是免票进入的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博物馆售票员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再说一遍，没有“米诺斯展厅”，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博物馆售票员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但“东北部分支”展厅不时展出一些你所说的米诺斯文物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“东北部分支”？"},{"type":"narration","text":"来自异国的游客深吸了一口气，裸露的手臂肌肉随着她握拳的动作而鼓起。\n售票员下意识地想拉下小窗口的活木板，游客却一手牢牢地托住了木板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"历史是这片大地上所有人共同跋涉的一条长河。塔尔萨萨古镇的源石工坊由高卢探险家掘出，阿加门古国的传说经卷被米诺斯工匠复原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而米诺斯自己的历史逆着河流散佚于黄沙，我只为一瞥它的残章上溯至此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否认同，历史学者的使命是寻找人们忘却的过去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为此，应该阻止握有强权的掠夺者出于自己的傲慢厚此薄彼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换言之，如果你认为萨尔贡自己的历史值得人们付出一百第纳尔，那米诺斯难道不该与之相等？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博物馆售票员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博物馆售票员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您到底需不需要门票？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——更重要的是，萨尔贡人恰好就站在掠夺者的立场上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话已至此，你愿意秉持自己的良知，正视馆内米诺斯文物的价值吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博物馆售票员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米诺斯游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"名字，赫里亚的阿斯帕齐娅。请用米诺斯语的拼写法，不要用萨尔贡语转写。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我一张票，谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
